{
  "platform_id": "mS6Jqq_GWlo",
  "profile": {
    "video_id": "iron-snail:mS6Jqq_GWlo",
    "purpose": "A walkthrough of the creator's 15-pair boot collection, deciding for each pair whether to keep, store or sell it because his girlfriend is moving into his small New York apartment.",
    "video_type": "other",
    "thesis": "Michael goes through every boot he owns, sharing his history and impressions of each, and decides which few to keep and which to sell, store or donate to make room.",
    "key_takeaways": [
      "The collection is culled for space: the goal stated at the start is to cut 15 boots down to about three, though more than three end up kept or stored.",
      "Each pair gets a brief verdict (keep, store, sell or reconsider) with reasons covering fit, construction, comfort, looks, sentimental value and use as a comparison benchmark for future videos.",
      "Sizing problems are a recurring reason to sell, for example the L.L.Bean Boots, Solovair monkey boots and Wolverine 1000 Miles.",
      "Several pairs are kept for upcoming comparison videos, such as Doc Martens against Timberland and 'Doc Marten killers', and the Hoka against the Russell Moccasin on hikes.",
      "The video ends with the Wolverine 1000 Mile pair he won in a contest in high school, which he credits with starting his interest in clothing."
    ],
    "outline": [
      {
        "title": "Intro and Russell Moccasin Backcountry",
        "summary": "Introduces the Russell Moccasin Backcountry, its link to the first Appalachian Trail thru-hike and its handmade Wisconsin construction, then explains why the collection is being culled. These are kept as his favourite boots.",
        "first_segment": 0,
        "last_segment": 1
      },
      {
        "title": "Doc Martens 1460",
        "summary": "The Doc Martens 1460s go into long-term storage rather than being sold, so they can serve as a comparison for an upcoming Timberland review and a 'Doc Marten killer' boot.",
        "first_segment": 1,
        "last_segment": 2
      },
      {
        "title": "Blundstone 989 Extreme Series",
        "summary": "Describes the heavy-duty Blundstone work boot: steel toe, fire and electrical hazard resistance, water-resistant nubuck and added height. It is being let go.",
        "first_segment": 2,
        "last_segment": 3
      },
      {
        "title": "Red Wing 8833",
        "summary": "He regrets buying the Red Wing 8833s because of how they look on his feet and their stiff leather. He is getting rid of them, but first they will be used in a secret experiment on his second channel.",
        "first_segment": 3,
        "last_segment": 4
      },
      {
        "title": "Sponsor: Squarespace / Jim Green Stockman",
        "summary": "A Squarespace sponsor read written as a parody review of the Jim Green Stockman Chelsea boot.",
        "first_segment": 4,
        "last_segment": 5
      },
      {
        "title": "Jim Green Razorback (fudge)",
        "summary": "The Jim Green Razorbacks are kept as his favourite Jim Green boot because they are comfortable, durable, well padded and age well.",
        "first_segment": 5,
        "last_segment": 5
      },
      {
        "title": "Hoka Kaha 2 GTX",
        "summary": "The Hoka hiking boot, which he calls a computer for your feet, is kept for now ahead of a hiking comparison with the Russell Moccasins.",
        "first_segment": 5,
        "last_segment": 6
      },
      {
        "title": "Rhodes Portland Boot",
        "summary": "He praises the sleek silhouette, stormwelt construction and weather-resistant suede, but sells the boot to make room because he has covered it many times.",
        "first_segment": 6,
        "last_segment": 6
      },
      {
        "title": "Blundstone 585",
        "summary": "The heavily worn Blundstone 585s, the subject of his first ever video, have held up and stayed water resistant. He is retiring them.",
        "first_segment": 6,
        "last_segment": 7
      },
      {
        "title": "Red Wing 3335",
        "summary": "He once called the stitchdown, lighter Red Wing 3335s his favourite Red Wings, but they are going.",
        "first_segment": 7,
        "last_segment": 7
      },
      {
        "title": "Slip-on boots for quick errands",
        "summary": "He talks about boots he can 'flop on' quickly for errands or rain and keeps a slip-on pair, though he says it could easily go on the sell list.",
        "first_segment": 7,
        "last_segment": 8
      },
      {
        "title": "Solovair Monkey Boots",
        "summary": "Recaps a quality-control problem and Solovair's customer service, plus a loose fit he attributes to wrong sizing. He would sell them only to buy another pair of monkey boots.",
        "first_segment": 8,
        "last_segment": 9
      },
      {
        "title": "Outfit aside",
        "summary": "He mentions what he is wearing, a Wonder Looper super heavyweight t-shirt and Wrangler Cowboy Cut jeans, and his wish to dress more adventurously.",
        "first_segment": 9,
        "last_segment": 10
      },
      {
        "title": "L.L.Bean Boots",
        "summary": "He declares his love for Bean Boots and tells how he ended up buying a pair too big. He will sell them and buy another pair.",
        "first_segment": 10,
        "last_segment": 11
      },
      {
        "title": "Croc western boots",
        "summary": "Croc western boots from Huckberry that he jokes about selling but is keeping.",
        "first_segment": 11,
        "last_segment": 11
      },
      {
        "title": "Viberg 145",
        "summary": "His first Vibergs, natural waxed flesh shoe boots worn around Amsterdam and Denmark, which haven't won him over yet.",
        "first_segment": 11,
        "last_segment": 12
      },
      {
        "title": "Wolverine 1000 Mile and outro",
        "summary": "The story of winning Wolverine 1000 Miles in a high school Instagram contest, the boots that started his clothing obsession, which he can't sell. The video closes with thanks and a plug for his second channel.",
        "first_segment": 12,
        "last_segment": 13
      }
    ],
